    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "報名截止前幾天。中天 soc 房，只有凌晨和家綸。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "jialun",
      "expr": "05-nod",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jialun",
      "text": "你的中學同學綺珊，會不會參加這次聖誕浪漫觀星營？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "jialun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "04-cold",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "我不太清楚。迎新夜、迎新露營、不過夜觀星，她都沒有來。以她的慣例，可能只有內蒙團 re-union 她才來。怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "jialun",
      "expr": "01-murmur",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jialun",
      "text": "是嗎？她不會來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "jialun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "05-fire",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "怎麼這麼關心那傢伙來不來？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "jialun",
      "expr": "02-happy",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jialun",
      "text": "喂，凌晨。我們是不是朋友？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "jialun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "01-shrug",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "jialun",
      "expr": "03-stammer",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jialun",
      "text": "我告訴你一件事，但你千萬別告訴別人。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "jialun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "01-shrug",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "好，我應承你。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "jialun",
      "expr": "04-sad",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jialun",
      "text": "其實，我很喜歡綺珊，非常非常的喜歡。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "jialun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "02-blush",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "嘩！好個黑加侖子！真是大膽！這樣的說話都說得出口！你認識了人家多久了？難得竟然有人會喜歡綺珊那小妮子，而且那人更是這個老實頭——家綸那小子的品味也令我極度質疑。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "jialun",
      "expr": "05-nod",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jialun",
      "text": "我想見一見她，而且，找個機會告訴她，向她表白。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "jialun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "04-cold",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "所以？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "jialun",
      "expr": "01-murmur",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jialun",
      "text": "所以，請你幫我邀請她，邀請她來這個聖誕浪漫觀星營。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "jialun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "05-fire",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "好。我一定盡力地說服她。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "jialun",
      "expr": "02-happy",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jialun",
      "text": "凌晨，謝謝你。太謝謝你了。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "jialun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "01-shrug",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "警告你，男人老狗別在我面前流眼淚。我該做的會做。上了場就看你自己。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "他還是一把鼻涕一把眼淚。那碟飯凌晨吃不下了。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "jump",
      "to": "ch10-star"
    }
  ]
